<div id="2026-08-20-ai-chat-create-todo" class="cl-entry">
<h3>2026-08-20 — Chat-with-AI can create todos on the current SiteName</h3>
<div class="container">
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-100">
            <p class="doc-body">The floating Chat-with-AI widget and the AI2 editor chat now share one todo-create brain: <code>Model::AI2::TodoCreate</code> via <code>POST /ai2/action</code> (<code>create_todo</code> / <code>resolve_todo_project</code>). Todos use the SiteName of the site you are on, match a project or sub-project, and ask whether to create a new project when none fit. The 📝 button and a natural-language “add a todo…” both go through that path — they no longer dump onto project #1.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</div>
